  {
    "name": "studio-paths-matrix-masks",
    "description": "(5) MatrixPCDefense_v4.3 (all-zero ally masks in its w3i; the editor refuses it without a war3map.wtg, so make-studio-paths.mjs adds echo's): the editor's save against Studio's pack. Differs for the editor's own reasons, not the masks: the map has no placed units, so the editor places start locations of its own (player 0 at -8960,-3968; the w3i says -3400,6300) and writes them and the masks worked out from them into the w3i (that those masks agree with allies.rs's rule for the editor's starts was seen by hand once; this spec only checks that the starts, the masks and the names are what differs); the borrowed wtg/wts make the player names TRIGSTR_00n",
    "input": {
      "map": "${REPO}/target/studio-paths/matrix.w3x"
    },
    "we": {
      "mode": "sd",
      "saveAccept": [
        "Warning"
      ],
      "steps": []
    },
    "studio": {
      "steps": [
        {
          "sleep": 500
        }
      ]
    },
    "compare": [
      {
        "file": "war3map.w3i",
        "as": "parsed",
        "ignore": [
          "version",
          "editorVersion",
          "gameVersion",
          "loadingScreen.crestRace",
          "terrainFog",
          "cameraZoom",
          "water",
          "playerHudSkins",
          "players[].hudSkin"
        ],
        "tolerance": 0.01,
        "expect": "differs",
        "expectPaths": [
          "players[].start",
          "players[].allyLow",
          "players[].name"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "limit": 30
  },
